## The idea behind the project

Entrepreneurs are often presented through lists of achievements, company valuations, and personal biographies. That format tells visitors what happened, but it doesn't necessarily help them understand how an idea developed into a business.

This project takes a different approach.

It follows a simple narrative:

Observation → Idea → Company → Expansion → Impact → Lessons

The website begins with the everyday problem that inspired Mazzella's idea, takes visitors through the major stages of the business, introduces the ventures connected to it, and ends with lessons about entrepreneurship.

The visitor can read the page from top to bottom or explore individual milestones and ventures based on their interests.

