The problem

Mazzella wanted to travel from Paris to Vendée to spend Christmas with his family, but the trains were fully booked. His sister eventually drove to pick him up. During the journey, he noticed how many cars on the road had only their driver in them.

The opportunity

He realised that spare seats in existing vehicles could potentially be made available to other people travelling in the same direction.

