This moment illustrates a fundamental entrepreneurial skill: problem identification.

Rather than starting with a technology and looking for a use for it, Mazzella started with an experience and recognised an unmet need.

For the website, this milestone introduces the central idea behind the entire project.

## Milestone 2: 2006 — Turning the idea into a company

The idea required more than recognising a problem. It needed a functioning service that people could use.

According to BlaBlaCar's official history, Mazzella founded the company in 2006 under the name Covoiturage.fr, after a period of development. The early work involved building a platform to connect people offering rides with people seeking them.&#x20;

