# 8. Technical implementation — how the code works

The project uses three web technologies, all contained in one `index.html` file.

| Technology | Responsibility                                  | Example from this project                                       |
| ---------- | ----------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |
| HTML       | Defines the content and semantic structure      | `<header>`, `<main>`, `<section>`, `<article>`                  |
